{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-1-34","kind":"proposition","title":"平行四边形的对边、对角与对角线","englishTitle":"In parallelogrammic areas the opposite sides and angles are equal to one another, and the diameter bisects the areas.","book":1,"number":34,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:1.prop.34","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:1.prop.34/","group":"prop","sourceNumber":34,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/zh-hans/幾何原本/卷一"}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-1-34@raw-3dc3ba070e04bbf2","contentId":"euclid-1-34","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"3dc3ba070e04bbf2bb5c685e69f89c93e7b8ccb4e80eacb43b8b8a90a613e05a","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-1-34.statement","euclid-1-34.construction.1","euclid-1-34.proof.1","euclid-1-34.proof.2","euclid-1-34.proof.3","euclid-1-34.proof.4","euclid-1-34.proof.5","euclid-1-34.proof.6","euclid-1-34.proof.7","euclid-1-34.proof.8","euclid-1-34.conclusion","euclid-1-34.historical.1","euclid-1-34.historical.2","euclid-1-34.historical.3","euclid-1-34.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-1-34.statement","contentId":"euclid-1-34","revisionId":"euclid-1-34@raw-3dc3ba070e04bbf2","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"bb3afcb733da60372789ba7f4d4240e4a58d73ec9dc0622337cf7e37771081b2","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"In parallelogrammic areas the opposite sides and angles are equal to one another, and the diameter bisects the areas."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"在平行四边形层区域,对面面和角度是等同的,对角线是这些区域之间的两部分。"},{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"凡平行线方形每相对两边线各等每相对两角各等对角线分本形两平分"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"对于任何平行四边形，每条对边的直线相等，每个对角也等于对角线，将此形状平分。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-34.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-1-34","revisionId":"euclid-1-34@raw-3dc3ba070e04bbf2","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"e94ad404b650bf6b2e7e30d9bda4e6d21806ad4a576df2d8d3ff69bf94e2847c","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let ACDB be a parallelogrammic area, and BC its diameter; I say that the opposite sides and angles of the parallelogram ACDB are equal to one another, and the diameter BC bisects it."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"让ACDB是一个平行的图区,对角线为BC;我说,平行四边形 ACDB的对面和角度是等的,对角线为BC双切。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-34.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-1-34","revisionId":"euclid-1-34@raw-3dc3ba070e04bbf2","order":2,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"413785de839640c78141cd943806458a61ca1b221690f8d67c519e44b9916747","citations":["euclid-1-29"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For, since AB is parallel to CD, and the straight line BC has fallen upon them, the alternate angles ABC, BCD are equal to one another. [[I. 29](/principles/euclid-1-29)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因为,由于AB线与CD线平行,BC直线也落在它们身上,内错角 ABC、BCD线是等同的。 [[I. 29](/principles/euclid-1-29)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-34.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-1-34","revisionId":"euclid-1-34@raw-3dc3ba070e04bbf2","order":3,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"e0b333c94656259d5e9d330b1d7e80b3e2d709ecfdace576c2523585109e6a03","citations":["euclid-1-29"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Again, since AC is parallel to BD, and BChas fallen upon them, the alternate angles ACB, CBD are equal to one another. [[I. 29](/principles/euclid-1-29)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"同样,由于AC与BD相平行,而BChas也落在它们身上,内错角 ACB CBD是彼此相等的。 [[I. 29](/principles/euclid-1-29)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-34.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-1-34","revisionId":"euclid-1-34@raw-3dc3ba070e04bbf2","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"aaefe947da013e51c72b14b5bd541c8e4eb76d065df895d32423c4ee98e6a14b","citations":["euclid-1-26"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore ABC, DCB are two triangles having the two angles ABC, BCA equal to the two angles DCB, CBD respectively, and one side equal to one side, namely that adjoining the equal angles and common to both of them, BC; therefore they will also have the remaining sides equal to the remaining sides respectively, and the remaining angle to the remaining angle; [[I. 26](/principles/euclid-1-26)] therefore the side AB is equal to CD, and AC to BD, and further the angle BAC is equal to the angle CDB."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,ABC,DCB是两个三角形,两个角分别为ABC,BCA和DCB,两个角等于DCB,CBD,另一面等于一面,即平行的角和它们共同的角,BC;因此,它们中的其余方将分别与其余方相等,其余角则与其余角相等;因此,AB面等于CD,AC至BD,此外,BAC角等于CDB角。 [[I. 26](/principles/euclid-1-26)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-34.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-1-34","revisionId":"euclid-1-34@raw-3dc3ba070e04bbf2","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"cdb18b5aa42c7bd670083d60684dca46665b526776c8f0e1d0d2201b6e6a0c80","citations":["euclid-1-cn-2"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And, since the angle ABC is equal to the angle BCD, and the angle CBD to the angle ACB, the whole angle ABD is equal to the whole angle ACD. [[C.N. 2](/principles/euclid-1-cn-2)] And the angle BAC was also proved equal to the angle CDB."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"由于ABC角度等于BCD角度,CBD角度等于ACB角度,整个ABD角度等于整个ACD角度。BAC角度也证明等于CDB角度。 [[C.N. 2](/principles/euclid-1-cn-2)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-34.proof.5","contentId":"euclid-1-34","revisionId":"euclid-1-34@raw-3dc3ba070e04bbf2","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"2e3ce423e027d582d3edc860605640d4c991700b9c44789d5cc9ff5e4cc17657","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore in parallelogrammic areas the opposite sides and angles are equal to one another."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,在平行四边形层区域,对面和角度是等同的。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-34.proof.6","contentId":"euclid-1-34","revisionId":"euclid-1-34@raw-3dc3ba070e04bbf2","order":7,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 6","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"b6bdba890b54d3ccc16c766c0b204c067904c2dc56d9bd7135d13a114eee95fe","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"I say, next, that the diameter also bisects the areas."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"我说,接下来,直径也使区域两分。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-34.proof.7","contentId":"euclid-1-34","revisionId":"euclid-1-34@raw-3dc3ba070e04bbf2","order":8,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 7","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"f038766ae4df56c0557a79efa10e25c4335111bd1015b3d5896266a7597cce7b","citations":["euclid-1-4"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For, since AB is equal to CD, and BC is common, the two sides AB, BC are equal to the two sides DC, CB respectively; and the angle ABC is equal to the angle BCD; therefore the base AC is also equal to DB, and the triangle ABC is equal to the triangle DCB. [[I. 4](/principles/euclid-1-4)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因为AB等于CD,BC是共同的,双方AB,BC等于DC,CB;角度ABC等于角度BCD;因此,底边,AC也等于角度DB,三角形ABC等于三角形DCB。 [[I. 4](/principles/euclid-1-4)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-34.proof.8","contentId":"euclid-1-34","revisionId":"euclid-1-34@raw-3dc3ba070e04bbf2","order":9,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 8","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"05b73a508b2fdf33bdcdc51c4445b70442c938e58c12c1447f27f27754149fdf","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore the diameter BC bisects the parallelogram ACDB."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此对角线为BC, 对角线为平行四边形, ACDB。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-34.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-1-34","revisionId":"euclid-1-34@raw-3dc3ba070e04bbf2","order":10,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"a767bacf26447ac75c1864eb85eb90c16406ee2f0184be6b8ee076c3e1a38d5c","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"证毕。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-34.historical.1","contentId":"euclid-1-34","revisionId":"euclid-1-34@raw-3dc3ba070e04bbf2","order":11,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"a1f1d6441b8a84170723bf1e16c8f09699096f273a6c46cab953610a449aa824","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"凡平行线方形每相对两边线各等每相对两角各等对角线分本形两平分"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"对于任何平行四边形，每条对边的直线相等，每个对角也等于对角线，将此形状平分。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-34.historical.2","contentId":"euclid-1-34","revisionId":"euclid-1-34@raw-3dc3ba070e04bbf2","order":12,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"6d6405cb34e9a68d03d8aacda246c060cd0b7bd0f92ed816cf0917d19176eb89","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"解曰：甲乙丁丙平行方形〈界说三五〉题言甲乙与丙丁两线甲丙与乙丁两线各等又言乙与丙两角乙甲丙与丙丁乙两角各等又言若作甲丁对角线即分本形为两平分"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"说明如下：甲乙丁丙 平行四边形 〈界说三五〉 命题说明：直线 甲乙 和 丙丁 以及 甲丙 和 乙丁 都相等。此外，据说 乙 和 丙 的角相等，乙甲丙 和 丙丁乙 的角也相等。还说如果取 甲丁 的对角线作为对角线，则原始形状被平分。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-34.historical.3","contentId":"euclid-1-34","revisionId":"euclid-1-34@raw-3dc3ba070e04bbf2","order":13,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"eae746a34212b258a5a6c719e78da2f46f6e490810e74225a871120808e0526a","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"论曰：甲乙与丙丁既平行则乙甲丁与丙丁甲相对之两内角等〈本篇廿九〉甲丙与乙丁既平行则乙丁甲与丙甲丁相对之两内角等〈本篇廿九〉甲乙丁角形之乙甲丁乙丁甲两角与甲丁丙角形之丙丁甲丙甲丁两角既各等甲丁同边则甲乙与丙丁甲丙与乙丁俱等也而丙角与相对之乙角亦等矣〈本篇廿六〉又乙丁甲角加丙丁甲角与丙甲丁角加乙甲丁角既等即乙甲丙与丙丁乙相对两角亦等也〈公论二〉又甲乙丁甲丁丙两角形之甲乙乙丁两边与丁丙丙甲两边各等腰间之乙角与丙角亦等则两角形必等〈本篇四〉而甲丁线分本形为两平分"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"证明如下：由于 :甲乙 和 丙丁 平行，那么位于 乙甲丁 和 丙丁甲 对面的两个内角相等 〈本篇廿九〉甲丙，并且由于它们与 乙丁 平行，那么位于 乙丁甲 和 丙甲丁 对面的两个内角相等 〈本篇廿九〉甲乙丁，三角形 乙甲丁乙丁甲 和 甲丁丙 的两个角各相等。如果 甲丁 在同一侧，则 甲乙、丙丁甲丙 和 乙丁 都相等。如果 丙 和 乙丁甲 在同一侧，则 甲乙、丙丁甲丙 和 乙丁 都相等，并且 丙 和 丙 分别等于 乙丁甲 和 乙丁。丙 和 乙丁甲 都等于 丙丁甲丙甲丁。如果 甲丁 在同一侧，则 甲乙、丙丁甲丙 和 乙丁 都相等，而 丙 和 丙 分别等于 乙丁甲 和 乙丁。丙 和 乙丁甲 彼此相等。甲丁 在同一侧，所以 甲乙、丙丁甲丙 和 乙丁 都相等，而 丙 和 丙 等于 乙丁甲。丙 和 乙丁甲 彼此相等。甲丁角 0022 也相等。〈本篇廿六〉 和 乙丁甲 加上 丙丁甲，丙甲丁 加 乙甲丁 相等。如果 乙甲丙 和 丙丁乙 是对顶角，则这两个角也相等。〈公论二〉 和 甲乙丁甲丁丙 在两条相等边的两侧分别有 甲乙乙丁 和 丁丙丙甲，且 乙 和 丙 等长。因此，这两个三角形必须相等。〈本篇四〉，而 甲丁 是这条线的二等分及此形状。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-34.source","contentId":"euclid-1-34","revisionId":"euclid-1-34@raw-3dc3ba070e04bbf2","order":14,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"ec3aecd878f242f0ccb48be2c8870666c15267d1a95c9f2963b84913cd93ae54","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:1.prop.34/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:1.prop.34\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)\nHistorical Chinese source: https://zh.wikisource.org/zh-hans/幾何原本/卷一"}]}],"outgoingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-1-34:euclid-1-29:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-1-34","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-1-34.proof.1","euclid-1-34.proof.2"],"targetContentId":"euclid-1-29","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:1.prop.34","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:1.prop.34/","sourceLabel":"I. 29"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-1-34:euclid-1-26:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-1-34","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-1-34.proof.3"],"targetContentId":"euclid-1-26","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:1.prop.34","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:1.prop.34/","sourceLabel":"I. 26"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-1-34:euclid-1-cn-2:explicit","sourceC